                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.51/1486a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Liberia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Hood</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1922-05-12T14:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 12, 1922—2
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>14. You are instructed to inform Liberian Government that House of
                    Representatives passed Joint Resolution yesterday authorizing credit of
                    $5,000,000 to Liberia and it is hoped that prompt action thereon will be taken
                    by the Senate.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hughes</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
